  "assessment": [
    "Seven fresh adapters and two fixed-gate/finishing adapters retain full 10M plus corpus/direct strata, every coverage/difference check and exact 33-file gzip retention.",
    "No change to frozen generator, comparison, benchmark or cleanup helpers. Secure recorded seeds are unchanged and independently checked against historical seed records.",
